    "Native solitary modifier masks preserved through actual MouseButtonDown; Shift rows remap to ordinary, Ctrl proportional, Ctrl+Shift internal Border active-line-only, excluded on margins.",
    "PrepareProportional_Impl stores uint16 integer per-thousand preceding-border device shares for horizontal-writing rows on the vertical ruler; zero-width native fences imply zero block sums.",
    "CalcMinMax uses source proportional Border index+1 minimum then glMinFrame, Margin2 Count*glMinFrame, ordinary native limits and active-line-only previous visible lower border plus glMinFrame; no arbitrary new caps.",
    "DragBorders redistributes preceding rows, applies absolute selected end and translates following borders/table end; Margin2 uses nIndex0 and retains its post-proportional translation of later borders.",
    "ApplyBorders OBJECT_ACTLINE_ONLY reaches original Writer SetMouseTabRows bool, native SetTabRows hit-cell-only interval owner, original frame/box/line/cursor/history remain intact."
  ],
